    <Text>
      <!-- TODO translation -->
      <GUID>2143505567</GUID>
      <Text>The sand slips, the water flows, and gravity does the rest. This delicate process catches the zinc sediments that nature has patiently polished over the centuries.</Text>
    </Text>
    <Text>
      <!-- TODO translation -->
      <GUID>2143505568</GUID>
      <Text>Forget the lonely old prospector with his pan by the water's edge. Here, we sift alluvial sand on a grand scale. When the sun hits the sieve and makes those few nuggets shimmer, you quickly forget the dust in your eyes.</Text>
